{
  "info": {
    "name": "home-rental-service",
    "_postman_id": "e4ec778f-08fb-414f-adc2-0541756a4ad8",
    "description": "home-rental-service API collection.\n\n## Setup\nRun **Setup / Fetch Public Key** once per server session before using any auth endpoints.\nThat request stores the server's RSA public key in `rsaPublicKey`.\n\n## Sensitive field encryption\nThe collection pre-request script automatically encrypts `password`, `newPassword`, and `otp` fields using RSA-OAEP SHA-256 before every request. Values are prefixed with `ENC:` — the server strips the prefix and decrypts.\n\n## Collection variables\n| Variable | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `baseUrl` | Base URL (default: http://localhost:8080) |\n| `accessToken` | Set automatically after Login / Complete Registration |\n| `refreshToken` | Set automatically after Login / Complete Registration |\n| `registrationToken` | Set automatically after Verify Otp |\n| `rsaPublicKey` | Set automatically by Setup / Fetch Public Key |\n| `acceptLanguage` | Preferred response language for requests, e.g. ar or en |\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "var SENSITIVE = ['password', 'newPassword', 'otp'];",
          "var ENC_PREFIX = 'ENC:';",
          "var acceptLanguage = pm.collectionVariables.get('acceptLanguage');",
          "if (acceptLanguage) {",
          "    pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept-Language', value: acceptLanguage });",
          "}",
          "if (!pm.request || !pm.request.body || pm.request.body.mode !== 'raw') return;",
          "var body;",
          "try { body = JSON.parse(pm.request.body.raw); } catch (e) { return; }",
          "var toEncrypt = SENSITIVE.filter(function(f) {",
          "    return body[f] !== undefined && !String(body[f]).startsWith(ENC_PREFIX);",
          "});",
          "if (toEncrypt.length === 0) return;",
          "function encryptFields(publicKeyB64) {",
          "    try {",
          "        var forge = require('node-forge');",
          "        var der = forge.util.decode64(publicKeyB64);",
          "        var asn1 = forge.asn1.fromDer(der);",
          "        var publicKey = forge.pki.publicKeyFromAsn1(asn1);",
          "        toEncrypt.forEach(function(field) {",
          "            var encrypted = publicKey.encrypt(String(body[field]), 'RSA-OAEP', {",
          "                md: forge.md.sha256.create(),",
          "                mgf1: { md: forge.md.sha256.create() }",
          "            });",
          "            body[field] = ENC_PREFIX + forge.util.encode64(encrypted);",
          "        });",
          "        pm.request.body.raw = JSON.stringify(body, null, 2);",
          "        console.log('[Encryption] Encrypted: ' + toEncrypt.join(', '));",
          "    } catch (err) {",
          "        console.error('[Encryption] Failed:', err.message);",
          "    }",
          "}",
          "var cachedKey = pm.collectionVariables.get('rsaPublicKey');",
          "if (cachedKey) {",
          "    encryptFields(cachedKey);",
          "} else {",
          "    var baseUrl = pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl') || 'http://localhost:8080';",
          "    pm.sendRequest({ url: baseUrl + '/auth/public-key', method: 'GET' }, function(err, res) {",
          "        if (!err && res && res.code === 200) {",
          "            var key = res.json().publicKey;",
          "            pm.collectionVariables.set('rsaPublicKey', key);",
          "            encryptFields(key);",
          "        } else {",
          "            console.error('[Encryption] Could not fetch public key. Run Setup/Fetch Public Key first.');",
          "        }",
          "    });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Fetch Public Key",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var key = pm.response.json().publicKey;",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('rsaPublicKey', key);",
                  "    console.log('[Setup] RSA public key saved to rsaPublicKey.');",
                  "    pm.test('Public key fetched', function() {",
                  "        pm.expect(key).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/public-key",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "public-key"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Fetches the server's RSA public key (DER, Base64). Run this once per server session. The test script saves it to `rsaPublicKey` for use in the collection encryption script."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
